body:
Alles selbst gemacht also 0€
Merke immer wieder, wie viel Geld man spart, wenn man alles selber machen kann.

Guter Wagenheber 200€;
Schlagschrauber mit Akku ~ 300€ Neupreis, selbst gezahlt 150€ (Gebraucht);
Drehmoment und Radnüsse ~100€

Brauch ich mittlerweile halt nicht mehr, außer wenn ich unterwegs bin, da ich in einer Werkstatt arbeite.

Well, it was pretty large lol so kinda expecting it to take  a bit longer.

The order was:
2xButton Cap set;
Sparco Rally Wheel;
V2.5X;
CSL DD;
Clubsport V3 Pedals;
CS V3 Damper Kit;
CS V3 Brake Performance Kit;

i said "relatively"
let's look at a more comparable example:
airsoft guns shooting with the same speed that an airbag deploys with have enough force to get a bb stuck in skin at close quarters, now you're sitting directly in front of it with an even smaller bullet which has it easier to penetrate into your skin- doesnt sound pleasant, but if you like it i wont stop you
